OL,5,G2200 Omid Djalili: Namaste
OL,6,     F2/4. Omid tackles Iran, conflict
OL,7,     Fand identity, asking how we
OL,8,     Fnavigate an increasingly divided
OL,9,     Fworld without losing sight of the
OL,10,     Fpeople caught in the middle.
OL,11,G2230 Lemn Sissay's Origin Stories
OL,12,     F2/4. Poet Lemn Sissay's comic and
OL,13,     Fpoetic look at the treatment of
OL,14,     Fchildren raised in care, based on
OL,15,     Fhis own experiences. From 2016.
OL,16,G2300 Hearing With Hegley
OL,17,     F4/8. The Luton laureate visits the
OL,18,     FCheltenham Literary Festival, and
OL,19,     Ffinds that some poems just don't
OL,20,     Fwant to be read. From February
OL,21,     F2000.
